er, online retail and e-commerce stores, startups, and local businesses also hire them. Whether it\u2019s a big company or a small business, every organization with a website or online presence needs some sort of help with its SEO, making SEO one of the most sought-after careers.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-specialist-job-description\/#faq-question-1713941243031","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-specialist-job-description\/#faq-question-1713941243031","name":"7. What are the career prospects for SEO specialists?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SEO specialists have many professional opportunities to explore. They start with junior-level positions but can soon move to executive roles. After gaining a few years of experience, they can apply for an SEO manager role and then head of the department. They can also work as freelancers, start an agency, or become consultants. There is a lot of scope for SEO trainers and SEO bloggers, too.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8572","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/8"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8572"}],"version-history":[{"count":27,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8572\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":22666,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8572\/revisions\/22666"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/85